From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] rdkb-cli: show live client signal in topology

The topology identifies private and IoT clients but does not expose the link
metric driving steering decisions. Join each topology STA to the authoritative
client metrics snapshot by MAC, show its current band and RSSI below the stable
name, and retain RCPI plus metrics age in the tooltip.

Use a colored ring and compact legend for strong, good, fair and weak signal.
Poll client metrics with topology every two seconds, redraw only when RSSI,
RCPI, membership or freshness changes, and retain the existing drag and
optimize-layout deferral. A client API failure leaves the prior signal snapshot
in place rather than suppressing topology refresh.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [lab WebUI presentation]
